        "answer": {
          "short": "$-1.28$, $1.28$, $1.28$, $0.8264$, $0.8997$, $0.7261$ (in order).",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}P(-1.28<z<0.94)&=P(z<0.94)-P(z<-1.28)\\\\&=P(z<0.94)-P(z>1.28)\\\\&=P(z<0.94)-[1-P(z<1.28)]\\\\&\\approx0.8264-(1-0.8997)\\\\&=0.7261.\\end{aligned}$$",
